    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018080/extras/e05be2cc00987e85605aafb3189eb8b9.avif?t=1738495468\" /></div><br><br>The humble adventure of a plush duck named Uter in this cruel world. Why cruel? Uter is the faithful toy of the famous streamer and has long been hunted by evil agents. And Uter's passion for freedom only pushed the hunters to their cherished prey. But why are they chasing Uther, is it just to use him to control the streamer's actions? You will learn about this in our game My Name Is Uter.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018080/extras/60d7992416b48532e881366647ba9ed4.avif?t=1738495468\" /></div><br><br>If you want to brighten up one of your evenings - then welcome.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Effortless gameplay<br></li><li>Collecting absolutely unnecessary items for achievements<br></li><li>Calm environment<br></li><li>Cute characters (as well as NPCs with their monologues)<br></li><li>Without a long and boring story<br></li><li>Many secrets :0</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018080/extras/e05be2cc00987e85605aafb3189eb8b9.avif?t=1738495468\" /></div><br><br>The humble adventure of a plush duck named Uter in this cruel world. Why cruel? Uter is the faithful toy of the famous streamer and has long been hunted by evil agents. And Uter's passion for freedom only pushed the hunters to their cherished prey. But why are they chasing Uther, is it just to use him to control the streamer's actions? You will learn about this in our game My Name Is Uter.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018080/extras/60d7992416b48532e881366647ba9ed4.avif?t=1738495468\" /></div><br><br>If you want to brighten up one of your evenings - then welcome.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Effortless gameplay<br></li><li>Collecting absolutely unnecessary items for achievements<br></li><li>Calm environment<br></li><li>Cute characters (as well as NPCs with their monologues)<br></li><li>Without a long and boring story<br></li><li>Many secrets :0</li></ul>",
